{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04001","headline":"晦日宴高氏林亭 · 高绍","name":"晦日宴高氏林亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"啸侣入山家，临春翫物华。\n葛弦调绿水，桂醑酌丹霞。\n岸柳开新叶，庭梅落早花。\n兴洽林亭晚，方还倒载车。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"高绍","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04001.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04001","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}